OL,3,GNEWSAFirst driver wins appeal in A20
OL,4,Aspeeding dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorist has become the first person
OL,7,Fin a long-running saga to successfully
OL,8,Fappeal against an A20 speeding
OL,9,Fconviction.
OL,11,FThe dispute stems from conflicting
OL,12,Fspeed limit signs on the Kent-bound
OL,13,Fsection of the A20 in Sidcup,
OL,14,Fsouth-east London, between October 2023
OL,15,Fand October 2024, where a 40mph limit
OL,16,Fwas enforced amid flooding concerns. It
OL,17,Fresulted in numerous motorists
OL,18,Freceiving fines despite a rogue 50mph
OL,19,Fsign remaining.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
