OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFirst driver wins appeal in A20
OL,4,Aspeeding dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Abbott, from Kent, said he "was
OL,7,Fextremely pleased, not just for myself,
OL,8,Fbut for the thousands of drivers that
OL,9,Fhave been fined in this case".
OL,11,FTransport for London (TfL) defended the
OL,12,Fspeed limit's introduction and said it
OL,13,F"remains confident" that enforcing it
OL,14,Fwas correct.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
